# Runbook: name of the alert or failure

Copy this page for each alert. Keep it short enough to follow at 3 a.m.

## Symptom

What the person on call sees: the alert text, the dashboard, the user report.

## Impact

Who is affected and how badly. This decides how fast to escalate.

## Check first

1. The one command or dashboard that confirms the problem is real.
2. The most common cause, and how to tell whether it is that.

## Fix

Numbered steps, each a command that can be pasted. Say what success looks like after each one.

## Escalate

Who to call if the fix does not work within 15 minutes, and what to tell them.

## After the incident

Link to the postmortem, and update this page with anything that was missing.
